---
import SitePage from "../../layouts/SitePage.astro";
import Subnav from "../../components/Subnav.astro";
import ContactBand from "../../components/ContactBand.astro";
---

<SitePage title="Our story"
  ><Subnav /><section class="page-intro editorial-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our story / Founder’s story</p><h1>
      It started<br />with people.
    </h1><p class="lead">
      TOML grew from a belief that creative people deserve room to do their best
      work, and that those people can be anywhere.
    </p><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:48px">
      Virtyt Pula / Founder & Creative Lead
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="story-row split container">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / Why it started</p><h2>
        Room for<br />better work.
      </h2>
    </div><div class="body">
      <p>
        After working inside large agencies, I wanted to build a creative
        company where people had a voice in the work, received proper credit and
        could bring their own perspective.
      </p><p>
        TOML grew around that belief. Independent creatives, brought together
        with clear direction and care for what we make.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="story-row split container">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / How it grew</p><h2>
        One conversation<br />at a time.
      </h2>
    </div><div class="body">
      <p>
        I moved from Kosovo to London in 2017, with no network and English as my
        second language. I reached out to graduates, met creatives and knocked
        on agency doors. Each project was a chance to earn trust.
      </p><p>
        Those connections grew into collaborations with UNIT9 and Waste
        Creative, then Red Bull Media House and IDEO. Brands began coming to us
        directly. We kept building each team around the brief.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="timeline container">
    {
      [
        ["2016", "The first idea", "A creative company built around talent."],
        ["2017", "London", "New connections, project by project."],
        ["2019", "TOML LTD", "The collective becomes a UK company."],
        ["2026", "House of TOML", "Our creative home opens in Prishtina."],
      ].map(([y, t, d]) => (
        <article>
          <>
            <h3>{y}</h3>
            <h4>{t}</h4>
            <p>{d}</p>
          </>
        </article>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <section class="dark section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">The belief we keep coming back to</p><h2>
        Better ideas come<br />from different voices.
      </h2>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="story-row split container">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / Where we’re going</p><h2>
        More room<br />to make things.
      </h2>
    </div><div class="body">
      <p>
        As TOML grows, I want to protect the things that made it work. Staying
        independent. Keeping people close to the decisions. Creating more
        opportunities for our collective.
      </p><p>
        TOML Journal and Children’s Planet give us space for ideas of our own.
        The House in Prishtina gives us a place to come together.
      </p><div class="actions">
        <a class="text-link" href="/people">Meet the people</a><a
          class="text-link"
          href="/about/approach">Explore our approach</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <ContactBand
    heading={"An idea worth\ngetting together for."}
    copy="Tell us what you have in mind."
  /></SitePage
>
